+---
+id: "n_0979_d4c4"
+type: "note"
+title: "flutter_app AgentService tests: the default lightweight-ctor approval mode is ApprovalMode.write, which auto-DENIES unknown/custom tools (\"The user denied the \\"x\\" tool call.\" as the tool result). Any test exercising tool execution must set service.approval.mode = ApprovalMode.yolo (see existing tool tests). This silently neutered agent_service_test.dart's over-window guard test for a while — it passed vacuously on a 37-char denial result until gh-1077 IT work exposed it."
+author: "agent"
+date: "2026-09-30T11:24:31.389316Z"
+area: "project"
+topics: []
+source: "agent"
+accessCount: 0
+importance: 0.5
+tags: ["#note", "#source_agent", "flutter_app", "testing", "gotcha", "approval"]
+---
+
+
+# Note: n_0979_d4c4
+
+flutter_app AgentService tests: the default lightweight-ctor approval mode is ApprovalMode.write, which auto-DENIES unknown/custom tools ("The user denied the \"x\" tool call." as the tool result). Any test exercising tool execution must set service.approval.mode = ApprovalMode.yolo (see existing tool tests). This silently neutered agent_service_test.dart's over-window guard test for a while — it passed vacuously on a 37-char denial result until gh-1077 IT work exposed it.
+
+**By:** [[agent]]
+**Date:** 2026-09-30T11:24:31.389316Z
+**Area:** [[project|project]]
